issuecomment-3279293888","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110389","id":3279293888,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Ddg3A","user":{"login":"MewPurPur","id":85438892,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NDM4ODky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85438892?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur","html_url":"https://github.com/MewPurPur","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-11T08:56:57Z","updated_at":"2025-09-11T08:58:44Z","body":"> From the description this sounds like it works as intended:\n> \n> > Trims the text per character and adds an ellipsis to indicate that parts are hidden regardless of trimmed text length.\n\nIt doesn't. It says it adds an ellipsis to indicate that parts are hidden. Therefore, it shouldn't add an ellipsis if no parts are hidden, but it does. \"regardless of trimmed text length\" refers to the whole text, it doesn't mean the trimmed part length being 0 should still trigger an ellipsis.\n\nAnd just intuitively, what's the point of ellipsis if it doesn't indicate something was trimmed?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3279293888/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3279337423","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110389#issuecomment-3279337423","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110389","id":3279337423,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7DdrfP","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-11T09:04:13Z","updated_at":"2025-09-11T09:04:13Z","body":"From glancing at the code it looks like the setting this adds `OVERRUN_ENFORCE_ELLIPSIS` means it always adds it also seems implied by the [description of that flag](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/classes/class_textserver.html#enum-textserver-textoverrunflag)\n\nBut the documentation is ambiguous ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3279337423/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"pe